  // ---- fusee ----
  ['The mainspring lives in a drum: a coiled ribbon hooked to the drum wall at its outer end (the hook is riveted <em>into</em> the wall — a declared joint the intra-unit instrument checks). As it unwinds, its torque falls — a spring near full wind pulls much harder than one near empty, and a train driven directly would beat measurably differently across the reserve.']: '发条装在条盒里：一条盘绕的钢带，其外端钩在条盒壁上（钩子是铆<em>进</em>盒壁的——一处已申报的连接，由单元内仪器检查）。发条释放时扭矩下降——接近满弦的发条比接近放尽时拉力大得多，若轮系被直接驱动，走时在整段动力储备内会有可测量的差异。',
  ['The fusee is the correction: a cone with a spiral chain groove, chained to the drum. Fully wound, the chain pulls at the cone\'s <em>small</em> radius — high spring force, short lever. As the spring runs down the chain works toward the <em>large</em> radius — weaker force, longer lever. The product, torque into the train, stays near constant. Winding spools the chain back onto the fusee; a maintaining detent keeps the train driven while the wind briefly unloads it, so the escapement never runs backward.']: '塔轮就是这项修正：一个带螺旋链槽的锥体，用链条与条盒相连。满弦时链条作用在锥体的<em>小</em>半径上——发条力大，力臂短。发条释放后，链条移向<em>大</em>半径——力变弱，力臂变长。二者之积，即输入轮系的扭矩，几乎保持恒定。上弦时链条重新卷回塔轮；上弦短暂卸载轮系期间，由维持动力棘爪继续驱动轮系，因此擒纵机构绝不会倒转。',
  ['Fusee &amp; chain — constant force from a dying spring<span class="where">power · src/main.js</span>']: '塔轮与链条 — 从渐弱的发条中取出恒力<span class="where">动力 · src/main.js</span>',
  ['PLATE 1']: '图版 1',
  ['Seen from the side, the whole bargain is one drawing. The chain leaves the drum\'s coil, crosses a span of open plate and climbs the cone\'s groove, and BOTH of its ends travel while it does: the cone\'s active groove rises as the wrap builds, and the drum\'s coil descends from its hook one chain thickness per turn. Plate 1 is that elevation, driven by the reserve — every wrap and every coil turn plotted from the parametric curve the sim cuts its links from.']: '从侧面看，整笔交易就是一张图。链条离开条盒上的盘绕，跨过一段敞开的夹板，再爬上锥体的沟槽——而在这过程中它的两端都在移动：随着缠绕增多，锥体上的工作沟槽逐级上升；条盒上的盘绕则从它的钩子起，每一圈下降一个链条厚度。图版 1 就是这幅立面图，由动力储备驱动——每一圈缠绕、每一圈盘绕都出自模拟切出链节所用的同一条参数曲线。',
  ['One mechanism is left, and it is the one that makes a fusee usable. Winding turns the cone <em>backwards</em> against the train — so for as long as you are winding, the thing that drives the watch has let go of it. Harrison\'s answer is a sandwich at the great wheel: the wheel runs loose on the arbor, and drive reaches it through a second spring that is kept wound by the train itself. While the fusee reverses, that spring is what feeds the escapement, and a detent on the plate holds the wheel it pushes against.']: '还剩一个机构，而正是它让芝麻链塔轮真正可用。上条会把锥体<em>逆着</em>轮系往回转——因此只要还在上条，驱动这只表的东西就已经松开了手。哈里森的答案是头轮处的一组夹层：头轮松套在轴上，动力经由第二根发条抵达它，而这根发条由轮系自己保持上紧。塔轮倒转期间，正是这根发条在供养擒纵；夹板上的一枚止动爪则按住它所顶的那个轮。',
  ['The saw profile is the builder\'s own — root at 0.8·R, tip over the last 28% of the pitch (<code>sawRadiusAt</code>) — and both the pawl ride and the detent\'s return are the shipped laws: the pawls are placed by the relative angle flange-vs-wheel (exactly <code>windBack</code>, zero while running), and the detent is a §48 one-sided follower — a spring seeking a seat it can never reach, with the ring\'s teeth standing in the way — not a part welded to a profile. <b>The detent never sees reverse motion</b>, which is what makes a fixed pawl legal here and nowhere on the arbor: the maintaining wheel is a child of the train\'s rotation only, so winding cannot drag it backwards. The rates are the movement\'s own: one pawl snap per flange tooth, 24 to the fusee turn and 90 over a full 3.75-turn wind; one detent tick per rim tooth, which at one barrel revolution per 8 h is a tick every 20 minutes.']: '锯齿廓形就是构建器自己的——齿根在 0.8·R，齿尖占节距最后的 28%（<code>sawRadiusAt</code>）——棘爪的爬行与止动爪的回位也都是交付中的规律：棘爪由盘对轮的相对角度定位（正是 <code>windBack</code>，走时状态下为零），止动爪则是 §48 的单侧从动件——一根弹簧奔向它永远到不了的座位，而轮缘的齿挡在路上——不是焊死在廓形上的零件。<b>止动爪从不经历反向运动</b>，这正是固定棘爪在此处合法、在轴上任何地方都不合法的原因：维持力轮只挂在轮系的转动之下，上条无法把它往回拖。这些频率都是机芯自己的：每一个盘齿一次棘爪弹响，塔轮每转 24 次、一次 3.75 圈的满上条共 90 次；每一个轮缘齿一次止动爪跳动，按条盒每 8 小时一转计，即每 20 分钟一次。',
