  // ---- alarm-train ----
  ['Setting: the alarm crown turns a bevel pair onto a friction-set disc under the dial (the Vulcain/Memovox way — it holds wherever the crown leaves it, read to the nearest quarter mark), while a central alarm hand rides its own tube through the hand stack, styled as a steel shadow of the hour hand so parked it disappears under it. Winding: the same crown pushed home spools the alarm barrel through its own train. Striking: when the feeler trips (full entry above), the alarm barrel drives the striking wheel, and the hammer — its fall a real sprung member, not a spring <em>law</em> (§48) — beats the gong; the ring runs down as the barrel empties, or stops early if the crown is pulled (§45\'s arrest, plate 4 above).']: '调校：闹铃表冠经一对伞齿驱动表盘下的摩擦定位盘（Vulcain/Memovox 的做法——表冠停在哪儿它就保持在哪儿，读数取最近的刻度四分位），同时一根中心闹铃指针穿过指针叠层骑在自己的轮管上，被处理成时针的钢色影子，停放时便消失在时针之下。上条：同一个表冠推回后，经其专属轮系为闹铃条盒上弦。打簧：当感触杆触发时（完整条目见上），闹铃条盒驱动打簧轮，音锤——其落下是真实的弹性构件，而非一条弹簧<em>规律</em>（§48）——敲击音簧；铃声随条盒放尽而止，或在表冠被拔出时提前停止（§45 的制停，见上方图版 4）。',
  ['The arming run — pusher → pawl → column wheel → ring — is DRIVEN from its input rather than posed from its output: the press carries the pawl, the pawl indexes the wheel a whole tooth, and every member downstream stands where the surface driving it puts it — each hand-off measured shut at both parities on every battery run by <code>alarmHandoffs</code>. The only rate left in the chain is how fast a finger presses. What it does not claim is dynamics: no force, friction or spring rate is integrated anywhere in it, and TODO 31 records the debt that follows — the lock the column lifts has no return spring, so the column alone decides where it sits.']: '上闩链路——按钮 → 棘爪 → 柱轮 → 选择环——由输入端驱动，而非由输出端摆出：按压带动棘爪，棘爪将柱轮推进整整一齿，其后每一构件都停在驱动它的那个面所决定的位置——每一次交接都在每轮测试套件运行中由 <code>alarmHandoffs</code> 在两种奇偶态下测得为闭合。链路中仅存的速率就是手指按下的快慢。它并不主张动力学：其中没有任何力、摩擦或弹簧刚度被积分；TODO 31 记录了随之而来的欠账——柱子抬起的那道锁没有回位弹簧，因此只有柱子决定它停在哪里。',
  ['The overview: the crown sets the disc and winds the barrel; arming (the column wheel → §35 link) enables the release; the feeler trips at coincidence and the barrel drives hammer onto gong; the §45 rocker holds the feeler\'s tail to silence or arrest. Each box has its own entry with plates on this page.']: '总览：表冠既设定盘位又为条盒上弦；上闩（柱轮 → §35 连杆）使释放机构生效；感触杆在重合时触发，条盒驱动音锤敲向音簧；§45 的摆杆扣住感触杆尾部以静音或制停。每一个方框在本页都有配图版的专属条目。',
  ['Alarm train — set, wound, struck, silenced<span class="where">alarm · src/main.js</span>']: '闹铃轮系 — 设定、上弦、敲响、静音<span class="where">闹铃 · src/main.js</span>',
  ['The alarm at a glance — where each entry lives']: '闹铃一览 — 各条目所在之处',
  ['set · wind · silence']: '设定 · 上弦 · 静音',
  ['disc (set time)']: '盘（设定时间）',
  ['alarm barrel']: '闹铃条盒',
